                   <ul>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Analyze a real-world app interface.</li><br>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Review user empathy maps to identify potential security and usability issues.</li><br>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Select at least two different issues to focus on.</li><br>
